 poor response in Buxar, as villagers struggle with digital process", "para": "In Buxar district, the number of land and property registrations has decreased since August 3. The shift to a digital registration system is proving difficult for elderly villagers and residents. According to deed writers, many rural individuals are wary of the new paperless approach. The Aadhaar-linked system aims to enhance security and reduce fraud, prompting officials to recommend awareness initiatives to foster better understanding and acceptance among the community.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/paperless-land-registration-sees-poor-response-in-buxar-as-villagers-struggle-with-digital-process/133391999?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-153526/133391999.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}